{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1560082-what-should-be-involved-what-should-diff-be-to-get-off-or-baclk-onto-the-grid","id":1560082,"title":"what should be involved what should diff be to get off or baclk onto \"The Grid\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-05-18T21:32:27-07:00","id":1560082,"title":"what should be involved what should diff be to get off or baclk onto \"The Grid\"","content":"could come up in all kinds of games","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-24T15:48:02-07:00","id":1560184,"title":"","content":"Could you please expand on the question?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-25T02:27:49-07:00","id":1560201,"title":"","content":"What do you mean by &quot;the Grid&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-06T21:00:45-07:00","id":1560422,"title":"","content":"Haing an address SSN bank account etc being &quot;legit&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-07T01:14:07-07:00","id":1560424,"title":"","content":"Cash only purchases, squatting with no utilities in your name, using a fake name...<br /> This is just stuff off the my top of my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-07T09:58:56-07:00","id":1560434,"title":"","content":"Mechanically, being off the grid is modeled with the Anonymity Merit, which penalizes attempts to find you by paper trail; some splats have common situations which make this especially easy to narratively justify, like Prometheans, changelings, deviants, werewolves, vampires, and Sin-Eaters, while others will find it substantially harder or disadvantageous to do so without an extra layer of prep to bypass or launder utilities and finances, like demons (who need to produce documentation with real people with mundane relationships or steal falsified identities from God to pass for human), mummies (whose default state puts them at the center of an arbitrarily large group of cultists connected by ties of culture, business, or conspiracy), or mages (who can theoretically sequester themselves or rely on the resources of their Sect to withdraw from the outside world but can specifically benefit from holding status in groups and typically become what they are in ways that do not natural extend to faking their deaths).<br /> <br /> If you want to model the process of building an official legal presence, getting connected to the power and water grids, and so on, as a character who is not accounted for in public records, that would likely involve a lot of Politics and Socialize rolls and purchasing some Social Merits like Alternate Identity, or using supernatural powers to the same end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-07T10:09:02-07:00","id":1560435,"title":"","content":"The successful off-grid people I can think of are mostly the heads of large criminal organisations. They have both the sheer cash to make people do things they need done, as well as the muscle to avoid being simply ripped off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-09T21:47:24-07:00","id":1560504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1560082-what-should-be-involved-what-should-diff-be-to-get-off-or-baclk-onto-the-grid?p=1560435#post1560435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The successful off-grid people I can think of are mostly the heads of large criminal organisations. They have both the sheer cash to make people do things they need done, as well as the muscle to avoid being simply ripped off.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know about that, they tend to be pretty prolific. It's how they maintain their influence, if no one knows who Vito and Michael Corleone are they aren't going to be respected. In real life these people are really well known. From Pablo Escobar, El Chapo and other cartel bosses, the heads of the various Yakuza organizations and Triads, outlaw motorcycle clubs and prison gangs, even the hierarchies of the remaining mafia families are known to the general public, from top bosses to street bosses.<br /> <br /> People doing this tend to be more eccentric and outside of organizations, which require connections. A popular fictional example is probably Jack Reacher, while he has a documented past, after leaving the army he became a drifter who hitchhiked to get around, tossed away his clothes when they got dirty and bought new second-hand ones with cash he got from odd jobs and robbing criminals. An evil variant would probably be something like the Joker, who has muddied the ability of most to accurately pin him down when he wants to disappear, even unable to be identified by his DNA due to the chemicals that altered him, he similarly gets his money by stealing from others or doing odd jobs (usually villainous ones like developing chemical weapons to sell). In real life this just tends to be the domain of hermits, especially in modern America and other nations that track a lot of their populace. Even people like David Suelo, who put his life behind him and lives in a cave, has a blog.<br /> <br /> In addition to Satchel's suggestion of Anonymity you might grab the Alternate Identity merit, giving yourself fake personas to use when you need to interact with others and allowing you to slink back to your 'off the grid' life afterward. Untouchable might be worth it if your ST is playing with NPCs using clues to investigate. Depending on where you want to be located you might put dots in Survival or Streetwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-09T23:56:03-07:00","id":1560507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1560082-what-should-be-involved-what-should-diff-be-to-get-off-or-baclk-onto-the-grid?p=1560504#post1560504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know about that, they tend to be pretty prolific. It's how they maintain their influence, if no one knows who Vito and Michael Corleone are they aren't going to be respected. In real life these people are really well known. From Pablo Escobar, El Chapo and other cartel bosses, the heads of the various Yakuza organizations and Triads, outlaw motorcycle clubs and prison gangs, even the hierarchies of the remaining mafia families are known to the general public, from top bosses to street bosses.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I'd say people knowing who you are is different to being on the grid. Indeed, lots of those guys have to live off-grid precisely because they're well known.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-10T15:53:12-07:00","id":1560538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1560082-what-should-be-involved-what-should-diff-be-to-get-off-or-baclk-onto-the-grid?p=1560507#post1560507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, I'd say people knowing who you are is different to being on the grid. Indeed, lots of those guys have to live off-grid precisely because they're well known.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't stop with people knowing who they are, they have law enforcement agents dedicated to tracking their every move, their lives are watched over and tracked more than celebrities are by paparazzi. They live in owned property linked to them they have monetary assets and bank accounts that are also tracked. Their entire lives are under the microscope of every authority that makes up 'the grid.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-11T01:55:34-07:00","id":1560543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1560082-what-should-be-involved-what-should-diff-be-to-get-off-or-baclk-onto-the-grid?p=1560538#post1560538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They live in owned property linked to them they have monetary assets and bank accounts that are also tracked. Their entire lives are under the microscope of every authority that makes up 'the grid.'</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there's been a misunderstanding. I'm not saying this is standard practice. Just that those are the kinds of people who can actually go off-grid for long periods.<br /> <br /> I was thinking specifically of El Chapo and the various leaders of the Sicilian Mafia spending decades long stretches of time on the run.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-06-29T05:05:48-07:00","id":1561097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1560082-what-should-be-involved-what-should-diff-be-to-get-off-or-baclk-onto-the-grid?p=1560543#post1560543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think there's been a misunderstanding. I'm not saying this is standard practice. Just that those are the kinds of people who can actually go off-grid for long periods.<br /> <br /> I was thinking specifically of El Chapo and the various leaders of the Sicilian Mafia spending decades long stretches of time on the run.</div> </div> </div> </div>The thing is that this is a fail state in their schemes. Not a complete deal breaker, but an undesirable survival strategy. Also, frequently it's not that they're off the Grid, just concealment.<br /> <br /> For the question of the thread:<br /> <br /> What's involved:<br /> <br /> 1. Cut connections. Documents, logins, even meeting people. You cannot ID yourself in any way directly.<br /> <br /> 2. Burner connections. Since you still have to interact with the world, it must be through IDs you can cut loose. Even a fake ID you actually live under is being on the Grid, just hidden.<br /> <br /> 3. Proxies. Find people you can contact off the Grid, they do things for you. Remember you must contact them through Burner connections, even friends and family.<br /> <br /> 4. Off the Grid infrastructure. Find things that work off the Grid. Cash, generators, homemade water pumps. A cave in a forest with a pond or creek nearby and resources you can forage. A squat with clandestine access to energy and water.<br /> <br /> What's the difference:<br /> <br /> 1. Off the Grid you dedicate effort to not leave tracks. That's a step above just cleaning and/or covering those tracks, and is mostly done by constraining yourself instead of wasting time and effort with status quo maintenance.<br /> <br /> 2. The tracks you do leave you cut loose. That's an expensive tactic, as you're not trying to keep safe connections, you're just prepared to throw them away, move and start anew. For this reason, low cost connections are preferred, and even then connections become a lot of effort and time consuming in general.<br /> <br /> 3. You move a lot and stay away from most of society's infrastructure and convenience, even if living within a city. If your actual lair is fixed, you need to keep it off the Grid with effort.<br /> <br /> Getting back in is simple, you contact society. Depending on methods and reason, you may be an intermittent signal, contact people directly with your normal identity, then leave to go back to untraceable life style.<br /> <br /> Most people that want to go unnoticed prefer to conceal their tracks rather than sever them in that way. They're below the radar, usually going low profile, but not off the Grid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-13T19:19:13-07:00","id":1561672,"title":"","content":"Want to be off the grid? Become homeless; people won't even look at you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}